span></span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\">Trial Balance is imported from the ‘Tasks’ section and while adding the same you may select the `Type` as management only to enable the `from and to` dates as desired.</span></span></span></span></p></li></ul><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',Times,serif;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\"></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman',Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\"><span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; width: 635px; height: 228px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9207419462/original/x4PMZDbJ0C8xoLe0v8K8DHIFAVIBCqjr-g.png?1710241464\" width=\"635\" height=\"228\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9207419462\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;\"></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Rom